          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#methodology",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Decide if you want typed linting. If yes, set parserOptions.projectService: true +",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#methodology",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "tsconfigRootDir: import.meta.dirname and extend a *TypeChecked config. If you only want fast",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#methodology",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "syntactic linting, stay on recommended and skip projectService entirely.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#methodology",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Get the helper/spread right. tseslint.config(...) → spread array configs",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#methodology",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "(...tseslint.configs.recommendedTypeChecked). defineConfig(...) → no spread.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#methodology",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Scope out non-TS files. Add a { files: ['**/*.js'], extends: [tseslint.configs.disableTypeChecked] }",
