        {
          "text": "**Enabling *TypeChecked without projectService/project.** Typed rules need a Program; without",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "one you get \"parserOptions.project has been set … but … was not found\" or the rules simply don't",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
