          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Running typed rules over plain JS / config files. They error (no Program) or noise.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "disableTypeChecked on a **/*.js block.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Omitting tsconfigRootDir. Relative tsconfig resolution then depends on the CWD - flaky across",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "editor vs CLI vs CI. Always set import.meta.dirname / __dirname.",
