          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Treating eslint as the type-checker. Linting ≠ tsc. Typed linting catches practices, not",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/typescript-eslint-typed-linting/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "type errors; you still run tsc --noEmit.",
